Dawnstar — City Profile
Pillar 1: Structure
Name & High Concept: Dawnstar — a mining and shipping town on the
northern coast, perpetually cold, perpetually underfunded (living-
world.md, The Pale section, verbatim: "a hard, remote hold... perpetually
cold and perpetually underfunded").
Atmosphere & Core Conflict: A town running on too little sleep. The real
crisis (below) has nothing to do with Ismara, but every symptom of it —
sleeplessness, irritability, a shared vivid dream of something vast, cold,
and watching — reads exactly like the thing the party has actually been
tracking since Windhelm. That resemblance is coincidence, not design
(living-world.md: "This is coincidence. Vaermina is not tracking Ismara.
Vaermina is amplifying what's already in people's heads.")
